  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_OrdinarySharesSharesLessThanOneUnitMember">一単元(100株)未満の株式(注)１,３,５</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights>
